OL,3,APound rises to its highest level since
OL,4,Athe Brexit referendum
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pound has risen to its highest
OL,7,Foverall level since the Brexit
OL,8,Freferendum over a decade ago.
OL,10,FSterling has risen notably in recent
OL,11,Fweeks against the euro and the dollar,
OL,12,Fahead of an expected rise in interest
OL,13,Frates.
OL,15,FThe most-watched measure of the value
OL,16,Fof the British currency against a
OL,17,Fbasket of 18 of the world's main
OL,18,Fcurrencies this week reached its joint
OL,19,Fhighest level since the June 2016
OL,20,Freferendum, according to Bank of
OL,21,FEngland figures.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
