OL,3,AUkraine says bodycam video shows deadly
OL,4,ARussian double-tap bombing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bodycam video has been released by
OL,7,FUkraine police which they say shows the
OL,8,Fmoments between two powerful Russian
OL,9,Fbomb strikes that killed at least 40
OL,10,Fpeople at an aid centre and a shelter.
OL,12,FThe footage, from a camera on one of
OL,13,Fthe killed police officers, shows
OL,14,Fresidents of the southern village of
OL,15,FKamyshuvakha going to an underground
OL,16,Fshelter after the first attack on
OL,17,FMonday. Soon after a blast is heard and
OL,18,Fflames are seen as the shelter is hit.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
