OL,3,AUkraine says bodycam video shows deadly
OL,4,ARussian double-tap bombing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said more
OL,7,Fthan 30 people may still be under the
OL,8,Frubble, as a search operation continued
OL,9,Ffor the third day.
OL,11,FNine gliding bombs, some weighing
OL,12,F3,000kg, hit the village as people had
OL,13,Fgathered to get humanitarian aid,
OL,14,FUkraine said.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
